We do.

425
00:32:29,280 --> 00:32:30,880
And remember, we've been around for decades.

426
00:32:31,360 --> 00:32:34,080
So the brand presence is kind of ubiquitous in the industry.

427
00:32:34,240 --> 00:32:36,800
So there's a lot of word of mouth, but SEO is a pretty big one.

428
00:32:36,880 --> 00:32:38,720
We're getting a lot of traffic through the app store as well.

429
00:32:38,880 --> 00:32:46,560
I would say SEO, if people are not finding out through their buddies that are going and surfing, that SEO's, I think that's how I came in was that way.

