00:32:46,800 --> 00:32:48,400
But you also do a lot of content too, right?

431
00:32:48,800 --> 00:32:51,680
You do some surf videos and written content, if I'm not mistaken.

432
00:32:52,160 --> 00:32:52,640
We do, right?

433
00:32:52,960 --> 00:32:54,640
So everything on the platform is really content.

